}

{
  "proposedChange": "is currently marked at 1.9 times gross MOIC and a 24 per cent gross IRR.",
  "why": "The source explicitly states that Fund IV is 'currently marked at 1.9x gross MOIC and 24% gross IRR', not that it has 'returned' these figures. To remove the conflict, the wording is aligned exactly with the source’s valuation language while preserving the stated values."
}

{
