  "why": "The review flags first-person voice as inconsistent with the required third-person reporting style. The style rule explicitly allows replacing first-person pronouns with the named authoring organisation while changing nothing else. This edit swaps both instances of 'we' for 'Halden Group' and preserves the original claim, wording, and evaluative content exactly as required."
}

{
  "proposedChange": "Halden Group was attracted to Meridian on the strength of a track record that is, in Halden Group’s view, genuinely exceptional.",
  "why": "This keeps the author’s evaluative language and hedging exactly as written while replacing the first-person pronouns with the named authoring organisation, as the style guidance requires, and preserves an explicit actor rather than shifting to an impersonal voice."
}

{
  "proposedChange": "suggests key-person risk may be limited",
