}

{
  "proposedChange": "is currently marked at 1.9 times gross MOIC and a 24 per cent gross IRR.",
  "why": "The source explicitly states that Fund IV is 'currently marked at 1.9x gross MOIC and 24% gross IRR', not that it has 'returned' these figures. Using 'is currently marked at' aligns the draft with the source’s wording and avoids implying fully realised returns where the source only indicates current valuation."
}

{
