  "why": "The review flags first-person voice as inconsistent with the required third-person reporting style. The style rules allow only one change on a silent card: replacing first-person pronouns with the named authoring organisation while leaving the rest of the claim untouched. This revision swaps both instances of 'we' for 'Halden Group' and preserves all wording, hedging, and judgement exactly as written."
